	(uuid "59d580f2-180f-4c52-8215-2508c8a389e3")
	(paper "A3")
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "HOUR METER main board, Micro-Fit harness variant (chip-down, JLCPCB in-stock parts)\nOne sheet per former module: Power input, Opto inputs (817 2ch), RS485 (MAX485), ESP32 core + USB (DevKitC), RTC (DS3231), EEPROM (AT24C256, SOIC-8),\nIMU (MPU9250 -> MPU-6500 + LIS3MDL), Ports (UART, GPS, Qwiic, test pads), IO (AIN1, DOUT1) and Harness (J1, every field wire).\nSheet pins join by net name (labels at every pin). +5V, +3V3 and GND are global power symbols.\nThe vehicle supply (9-30 V) enters on J1 and feeds the on-board LM2596 5 V stage on the Power input sheet.\nReference designators are numbered per sheet: 1xx power, 2xx core, 3xx opto, 4xx RTC, 5xx EEPROM, 6xx IMU, 7xx RS485, 8xx ports, 9xx IO, J1 harness."
		(at 40 14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
